			"notes": "# 1.0.0-beta.6 \n\nThis update is focused on reliability. The mod now handles NATS downtime and server crashes gracefully, without losing player data.\n\n- If NATS goes down, player data is saved locally and synced back automatically when the connection returns.\n- Servers now block player logins until sync and recovery are fully complete.\n- The connection watchdog no longer times out. It will now wait indefinitely for NATS to become available without impacting the server.\n- Added a `/nats backup confirm` step to prevent accidental data rollbacks.\n\n\nFeedback and bug reports are welcome.\n\n**Full Changelog**: [v1.0.0-beta.5...v1.0.0-beta.6](https://github.com/xSaVageAU/NATS-Player-Data-Bridge/compare/v1.0.0-beta.5...v1.0.0-beta.6)"
		}
